flowchart LR
 CRM[Salesforce CRM: Leads, Accounts, Opportunities, Cases] -->|Closed-Won order; eligible audience| IP[Middleware / iPaaS: OAuth, mapping, validation, external-ID upsert, retry]
 IP -->|Validated order create| ERP[ERP: SAP S/4HANA example]
